instead be\\nsrc/cljc/yang/core/stage.cljc-66-   an options map of `:medium` and the config's `:option-keys`; the fifth,\\nsrc/cljc/yang/core/stage.cljc:67:   `max-digits`, is the digit budget of every packet that declares none.\\\"\\nsrc/cljc/yang/core/stage.cljc-68-  ([config cst-stream program-stream diagnostics-stream]\\nsrc/cljc/yang/core/stage.cljc-69-   (open-stage config\\nsrc/cljc/yang/core/stage.cljc-70-               cst-stream\\nsrc/cljc/yang/core/stage.cljc-71-               program-stream\\n--\\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/parser.cljc-106-(defn first-failure\\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/parser.cljc-107-  \\\"Where the grammar first refuses `source` (`yang.antlr.cst/first-failure`:\\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/parser.cljc-108-   nil, :end or :early), with a worker made for this call and disposed.\\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/parser.cljc-109-\\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/parser.cljc:110:   On jolt an input over the native parser's budget answers :early: more\\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/parser.cljc-111-   lines can only grow its size and its nesting, so it cannot be mended, and\\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/parser.cljc:112:   the parse stage then reports the qualified :parser-budget refusal.\\\"\\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/parser.cljc-113-  [source]\\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/parser.cljc-114-  (with-worker\\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/parser.cljc-115-    (fn [w]\\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/parser.cljc-116-      (try (cst/first-failure w source)\\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/parser.cljc-117-           (catch #?(:cljd Object :clj Exception :cljs :default) e\\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/parser.cljc:118:             (if (= :parser-budget (:diagnostic (ex-data e)))\\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/parser.cljc-119-               :early\\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/parser.cljc-120-               (throw e)))))))\\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/parser.cljc-121-\\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/parser.cljc-122-\\n--\\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/siteset.cljc-26-   missing, e